          "summary": "Add a mutual aggregate liability cap with uncapped Excluded Claims to § 15.11",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 15.11 excludes indirect damages but leaves each party's direct liability entirely uncapped, so we have added a mutual aggregate cap at the greater of twelve months' payments and US$1,000,000, consistent with our position on limitation of liability. Indemnification, confidentiality/data protection, gross negligence, willful misconduct, fraud, IP infringement and each party's express payment and funding obligations sit outside the cap.",
